      "seed": 1491230005,
      "version": 4232,
      "versionNonce": 85318694,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795328838501,
      "created": 1795250176104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n11. Disaster recovery - Automated backup and quick recovery (RPO < 5min, RTO < 15 min).\n\n12. Maintainablity - Modular well structure codebase with clear service boundaries.\n\n13. Observability - Centralized logging, metrics and tracking (e.g, ELK, prometheus, Grafana).\n\n14. Elasticity - Auto scale service based on realtime traffic and demand.\n\n15. Geographical distribution - Deploy services across multiple regions with low latency.\n\n16. Rate limiting - Prevent abuse and ensure fare resource usage.\n\n17. Compliance - Follow Payment (PCI-DSS), location and regulatory guidence.\n\n18. Extensibility - Easily add new features, like shared rides, subscription or new payments.\n\n19. Testability - support unit, integration and end to end testing with high coverage.\n\n20. Usability - Simple, intuitive and responsive experience for both rider and driver.",
      "fontSize": 21.958146380866605,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n11. Disaster recovery - Automated backup and quick recovery (RPO < 5min, RTO < 15 min).\n\n12. Maintainablity - Modular well structure codebase with clear service boundaries.\n\n13. Observability - Centralized logging, metrics and tracking (e.g, ELK, prometheus, Grafana).\n\n14. Elasticity - Auto scale service based on realtime traffic and demand.\n\n15. Geographical distribution - Deploy services across multiple regions with low latency.\n\n16. Rate limiting - Prevent abuse and ensure fare resource usage.\n\n17. Compliance - Follow Payment (PCI-DSS), location and regulatory guidence.\n\n18. Extensibility - Easily add new features, like shared rides, subscription or new payments.\n\n19. Testability - support unit, integration and end to end testing with high coverage.\n\n20. Usability - Simple, intuitive and responsive experience for both rider and driver.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
