      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795328803261,
      "created": 1795327135114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HikariCP: 200 Threads vs 10 connections.\n\n- Tomcat and DB connections are different limit\n- Hikari CP refuses limited pool of Database connections.\n- Once the pool is exhausted threads wait\n- Slow queries make connection contension worse.\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HikariCP: 200 Threads vs 10 connections.\n\n- Tomcat and DB connections are different limit\n- Hikari CP refuses limited pool of Database connections.\n- Once the pool is exhausted threads wait\n- Slow queries make connection contension worse.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
