      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- TTL Expiry can create a cache stampede\n- Distributed locking can prevent 1000s of request \nrebuilding the same cache simultaneously.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- TTL Expiry can create a cache stampede\n- Distributed locking can prevent 1000s of request \nrebuilding the same cache simultaneously.",
